  "notes": [
    "Stage coverage remains 314 sources and 1266 fixture/reference files. No reference or comparison rule changed.",
    "The corrected local declaration control and direct-initializer reducer fail under entry but execute correctly under the frozen declaration intermediate and final compiler, with equal LowIR and native hashes. C++11 rules are recorded in the proof manifest.",
    "The first personal control omitted typename and used unsupported function-local static storage. Its source and failures remain. The corrected control uses PA10-supported template static data members without weakening the specialization identity check.",
    "The initial positive proof harness passed a .t source to g++ without -x c++; that invocation failed before the harness correction. Both harness versions and logs remain, with unchanged reducer source.",
    "The initial grouped-write patch moved an entity publication under a value-dependence conditional. Review restored unconditional publication before the implementation freeze. Both the initial patch and initial/reviewed passing validation logs remain; tests alone did not identify the conditional change.",
    "Two isolated three-input trials retain 84 observations. The complete isolated 49-input/11-native campaign terminates with exit code zero and retains 840 more observations. No build/test/proof/layout process overlaps timing.",
    "All 49 A/B LowIR hashes and all 11 native hashes match exactly. No comparison adapter was needed. The unchanged comparison/contract hashes remain recorded.",
    "The declaration-fact layout checks 18 current transitive headers. Earlier layout guards retain frozen snapshot integrity; no mandated layout limit or prior measurement was removed.",
    "All source/key/use equations describe the frozen implementation and inputs; they are diagnostic ownership evidence, not permanent numerical gates. PA14 O0 has no mandated latency/RSS/compiler-text ceiling. Source/key/concrete-use storage, four O0 conversion variants per source operation, one local view per publication and zero generated growth remain explicit budgets.",
    "Full-stage architecture remains open at ordinary declaration/prototype/raw-parameter/query ownership and independent typed demand/failure/reverse dependencies. The concrete local binding, initializer correction and sparse Fact publication group is complete."
